OL,3,GNEWSAI loved capybaras before they were
OL,4,Aviral - I'm so glad they're having a
OL,5,Amoment
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey look like giant guinea pigs, they
OL,8,Feat their own poop, and the Vatican
OL,9,Fonce declared that they were fish.
OL,11,FCapybaras - the world's largest living
OL,12,Frodents - are unusual animals to say
OL,13,Fthe least, and in recent years - helped
OL,14,Fby some high-profile capers - the
OL,15,Fcapybara craze has gripped people
OL,16,Facross the world.
OL,18,FNow, a filmmaker has made a documentary
OL,19,Fall about them.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
