OL,3,GNEWSAI loved capybaras before they were
OL,4,Aviral - I'm so glad they're having a
OL,5,Amoment
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I loved capybaras before they were
OL,8,Fviral, I've loved them for many, many
OL,9,Fyears, but I'm so glad they're having a
OL,10,Fmoment," says Sharon Walia, who
OL,11,Fexplores the popularity of the huge
OL,12,Fherbivores in The Route to Cappyness.
